### C.jet_elements_taptweak_inverse_core.elements_taptweak_inv_core_private_outside
elements_taptweak_inv_core_private_outside
     : forall (m : Memory.Mem.mem) (bs : Values.block) (betaN : list (prod Values.block BinNums.Z))
